+      "rationale": "This exact nonempty-For transition, including its numeric sequence guard and complete state transformation, is LOOP-SPEC.for-cons in loop-spec.k lines 106-138. prove.sh lines 37-41 proves it using the bridge-free definition and the previously proved loop claims, before the corresponding reusable rule is introduced by the compilation at lines 44-47."
+    }
+  ]
+}

